# STEP-06 - V79 pilot Short

Status --> Planned

## Objective

Generate the first complete Short from the already validated Mini-Kuzai V79 result.

The V79 pilot will validate:
- automatic step numbering
- dynamic title and result overlays
- Piper narration
- background music
- FFmpeg rendering
- metadata generation
- private YouTube upload

## Exit criteria

The V79 Short is manually reviewed and technically accepted before any automatic public publication is enabled.
